 depends on it.\"","\"FY24/FY25 consolidated audit modifications and corrections are described at pp163–164, not characterized as an unqualified historical audit series.\"","\"2024\"","\"transformer_sales\"","\"traded_sales\"","\"distribution_kva\"","\"power_mva\"","\"160.1914\"","\"822278\"","\"305.85\"","\"322.5265\"","\"1175472\"","\"1156.75\"","\"336.5174\"","\"1375253\"","\"1285\"","\"entity\"","\"original_control_date\"","\"increase_date\"","\"ownership_before\"","\"ownership_after\"","\"fy26_external_revenue\"","\"fy26_pat\"","\"minority_cash_purchase\"","\"Haryana Power Industries (partnership)\"","\"2015-11-12\"","\"2025-05-19\"","\"0.9999\"","\"-0.1592\"","\"0.0437\"","\"Rental subsidiary and separate same-name HUF/proprietary related party are not interchangeable; consolidation elimination avoids double counting.\"","\"anchor_date\"","\"entry_date\"","\"terminal_date\"","\"hurdles\"","\"discount_rates\"","\"terminal_growths\"","\"primary_discount\"","\"primary_terminal_growth\"","\"starting\"","\"preentry\"","\"scenarios\"","\"INR crore, except rupee prices, days and integer shares\"","\"2026-03-31\"","\"2031-10-19\"","\".04\"","\".06\"","\"cc\"","\"term\"","\"2.9789\"","\"-3.3196\"","\"41.5881\"","\"11.2798\"","\"9.4566\"","\"dates\"","\"days\"","\"cc_observed_june\"","\"new_term_may\"","\"ipo_gross\"","\"ipo_expenses\"","\"ipo_net\"","\"ipo_month\"","\"ipo_term_repayment\"","\"ipo_prepayment_fee\"","\"project_cash_paid_by_prospectus\"","\"operating_tax_arrears_month\"","\"cash_capex_payable_month\"","\"debt_total_discrepancy\"","\"june_debt_bridge_repayment_assumption\"","\"later_monthly_term_principal_assumption\"","\"11.7302\"","\"108.73924\"","\"7.2834\"","\".1457\"","\"June table total26.1274 vs funded row sum29.7773; analyst starts March audited and explicitly adds May3.65, does not silently accept total.\"","\"ordinary_new_funding\"","\"existing_cc_drawable_headroom_committed_at_entry\"","\"optional_bank_rate\"","\"optional_equity_fee\"","\"optional_new_share_limit\"","\"no_preentry_rescue\"","\"no_automatic_debt_renewal\"","\".03\"","4106600","\"Every post-March operational balance and timing is an analyst scenario, not observed October cash. IPO actual issuance is verified; net cash timing/disbursement is assumed September30.\"","\"Existing published facilities are not automatically drawable commitments. No optional rescue in pre-entry; historical June CC increase and May LAP are separately disclosed modeled funding changes.\"","\"Project attribution of audited CWIP and capital advances to the new plant is assumed and stressed. Project capital payables are additional settlement of old assets and not double-counted into the project cost.\"","\"Cash floor0.05cr is analytical, not a covenant; test at0.25,1,2cr. A higher opening floor can mechanically fail at audited anchor and must remain failed.\"","\"Retention is not separately quantified by issuer; base0 means not independently separated, not proof of none. AR-plus-retention days stress adds identified analytical retention balances.\"","\"No discretionary dividend forecast; terminal cash is counted once after a liquidity reserve. No model price implies executable liquidity.\"","\"Rental costs remain expenses; no undocumented lease liability invented. No property-sale proceeds assumed due ambiguous units and related-party approval/valuation evidence.\"","\"Additional capacity capex beyond INR600cr annual sales uses INR0.35 per incremental rupee of sales, approximating project cost per added power MVA divided by FY26 power transformer revenue per MVA. New-plant mix, qualification and commissioning remain assumptions; terminal growth always bears this reinvestment, even if temporary headroom remains.\"","\"March debt plus observed June CC increment and May LAP gives30.1083cr. A0.3310cr June cash-repayment assumption reconciles the29.7773cr line-item June sum; it is not separately verified cashflow. July onward0.18cr monthly term-principal is an analyst assumption, not an observed balance; timing/debt-only gap remains.\"","\"Opening fixed41.5881 = total operating fixed/CWIP45.2435 minus CWIP3.6554; project5.8993 = CWIP3.6554 plus separate capital advances2.2439. Total47.4874 includes advances once. Intangible development0.0793 remains in the fixed approximation; modeled depreciation and maintenance are explicit estimates, not claimed issuer asset-level schedules.\"","\"test,path_id,funding,first_breach,entry_cash,entry_debt,bank_gross,equity_gross,terminal_shares,dilution,survival_eligible,ordinary_irr,conditional_irr,counterfactual_price,terminal_cash,terminal_debt,cash_reserve,next_fcff\\r\\nbear_none,3fcfe34a8efdf55aafe6c4543a964845f9af0039f53a0af998ee18f9f9d74a8d,none,\\\"{'index': 4, 'month': -7, 'stage': 'net_working_capital_investment', 'cash': '-8.1609690802348336594911937377690804', 'shortfall': '8.2109690802348336594911937377690804'}\\\",26.2700303109992033052565884989684604,21.8435774193548387096774193548387097,0,0,20893400,0,False,,,59.5314738524111402023135254644999330,-8.06417183178148682086980609234547327,0.0000000000000000000000000000000000000,3.15650301219436365968890070480501567,13.6819638536676360837331915423398119\\r\\nbear_bounded_optional,c4f65151662877daf5fb34c85b9da5576c3eff6fdd93e3dcbd67018c2b5d2fb2,bounded_optional,\\\"{'index': 4, 'month': -7, 'stage': 'net_working_capital_investment', 'cash': '-8.1609690802348336594911937377690804', 'shortfall': '8.2109690802348336594911937377690804'}\\\",26.2700303109992033052565884989684604,21.8435774193548387096774193548387097,0,0,20893400,0,False,,,59.5314738524111402023135254644999330,-8.06417183178148682086980609234547327,0.0000000000000000000000000000000000000,3.15650301219436365968890070480501567,13.6819638536676360837331915423398119\\r\\nbase_none,1a65437be6d3d0ed02334578dad133f7767d28812929202ce59ee14e2943cabe,none,\\\"{'index': 4, 'month': -7, 'stage': 'net_working_capital_investment', 'cash': '-1.6615561643835616438356164383561646', 'shortfall': '1